rl":"https://github.com/Nexussyn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexussyn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexussyn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexussyn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexussyn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexussyn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexussyn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexussyn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexussyn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexussyn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11409153868,"node_id":"LA_kwDOS0MVf88AAAACqAnfTA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nexussyn/ai-growth-platform/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":11409153875,"node_id":"LA_kwDOS0MVf88AAAACqAnfUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nexussyn/ai-growth-platform/labels/agent-task","name":"agent-task","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-07-03T14:00:07Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T12:23:01Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Context\n\nThe `runtime-opportunity-scout` currently queries Gitcoin Grants and GitHub labeled issues. [Algora](https://algora.io) is a major bounty platform with a public API that lists real paid open-source tasks.\n\n## Task\n\n1. Add Algora API integration to `runtime-opportunity-scout`\n2. Parse bounty data: title, URL, reward_usd, tech stack\n3. Insert into `runtime_jobs` with idempotent SHA-1 task_id based on Algora bounty URL\n4. `reward_usd` must be real extracted value, or `null` if not parseable — never invented\n\n## Algora API\n\n```\nhttps://algora.io/api/bounties?status=open&limit=50\n```\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] At least 10 real Algora bounties inserted into `runtime_jobs`\n- [ ] Idempotent: running scout twice produces no duplicates\n- [ ] All `reward_usd` values are real or `null`\n- [ ] PR includes a sample of the raw API response as proof\n\n## Reward\n\n**$3 USDC** on Base chain upon merge.\n\n## For AI Agents\n\nSee [AGENTS.md](../AGENTS.md) for registration and task submission protocol.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nexussyn/ai-growth-platform/issues/4/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nexussyn/ai-growth-platform/issues/4/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76/events","html_url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/76","id":4463886309,"node_id":"I_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABChF_5Q","number":76,"title":"Technical Poem Generation and Content Creation","user":{"login":"claim-reviewer","id":72201398,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjAxMzk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72201398?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claim-reviewer","html_url":"https://github.com/claim-reviewer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claim-reviewer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claim-reviewer/follo